---
<section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">IT support for one-man bands and consultants</div>
  <h1>Stop losing time to broken tech.<br />Get back to billable work.</h1>
  <p class="sub">Plain-English IT help for solo operators who need things fixed fast. Email, laptops, websites, Microsoft 365 and security — sorted without jargon, contracts or drama.</p>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn" href="#contact">Get help now</a>
    <a class="btn secondary" href="#offers">See fixed-price offers</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="bullets">
    <li>For consultants, solo service firms and one-man-band operators</li>
    <li>Remote-first support so you can get moving quickly</li>
    <li>Clear advice, clear scope, no corporate IT nonsense</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .eyebrow{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold)}
  .hero .sub{margin-top:10px;font-size:20px;max-width:820px}
  .actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}
  .btn.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--navy);border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .bullets{margin:22px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:10px;max-width:760px}
  .bullets li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;color:var(--muted)}
  .bullets li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:9px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold)}
</style>
